### K v0.8.3 HARDENING\
\
Pivetta exposed a major issue on Sep 7:\
\
* MODEL projected Pivetta xK ~6.22\
* Over 4.5 ~73.6%\
* confidence High\
* he finished with only 2 Ks\
* he had only ~66 current Savant BF and was returning from a long IL absence\
\
This led to v0.8.3.\
\
Small current-season pitcher samples are now shrunk toward:\
\
1. credible prior-season skill when available\
2. otherwise a league prior\
\
Shrink:\
\
* K%\
* Whiff%\
* SwStr%\
* Contact%\
\
Confidence now considers effective sample size and workload uncertainty.\
\
Workload states include concepts such as:\
\
* NORMAL\
* LIMITED\
* OPENER_LIKE\
* UNANCHORED\
\
A Pivetta-like 66-BF + limited-workload case can no longer remain clean `High` confidence.\
\
The raw mathematical signal may still exist, but Trust can block it.\
